<http://data.silknow.org/object/81c4a85f-335b-3889-80d9-8a685d9eced9/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment of a trouser panel (Nakshe) of plain weave cotton embroidered with silk in straight stitches.\n\nPieced. Incomplete design.  Appears to have a dark green ground with yellow lines in one half of it.  The flowers are largely shades of pink.\n\nThreads: light pink, light orange, yellow, dark green, dark blue, light blue, light green, red silk; 2S"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/81c4a85f-335b-3889-80d9-8a685d9eced9> .

<https://sws.geonames.org/130758/>
